.TH "rtcGetGeometryUserDataFromTraversable" "3" "" "" "Embree Ray Tracing Kernels 4"
.SS NAME
.IP
.EX
rtcGetGeometryUserDataFromTraversable \- returns the user data pointer
  of the geometry through the scene object
.EE
.SS SYNOPSIS
.IP
.EX
#include <embree4/rtcore.h>

void* rtcGetGeometryUserDataFromTraversable(
    RTCTraversable traversable,
    unsigned int geomID);
.EE
.SS DESCRIPTION
The \f[CR]rtcGetGeometryUserDataFromTraversable\f[R] function is
equivalent to \f[CR]rtcGetGeometryUserDataFromScene\f[R] but takes
traversable object (\f[CR]traversable\f[R] argument) instead of a scene
object.
Using this method is optional on CPU but it is required for SYCL.
.SS EXIT STATUS
On failure an error code is set that can be queried using
\f[CR]rtcGetDeviceError\f[R].
.SS SEE ALSO
[rtcGetGeometryUserDataFromScene], [rtcGetSceneTraversable]
